{"hash": "7713ae8388209fbdfea9b3c4d52d49229f2f349cabe5b868b03ebf6a31543c61", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "a4f1bb92d0e772166834206ab7ed93d404631fcc176aa608db3272e00122b1ec", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "7713ae8388209fbdfea9b3c4d52d49229f2f349cabe5b868b03ebf6a31543c61", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "208b482694d44ceec4e1a9cca1b400712a2651cef68e4c1c52b7235ac9d881ec", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "a4f1bb92d0e772166834206ab7ed93d404631fcc176aa608db3272e00122b1ec", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6bdf53f2ef9b121545b6041104cc873d362360efc7520bf762cb027354410a4f", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "208b482694d44ceec4e1a9cca1b400712a2651cef68e4c1c52b7235ac9d881ec", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cc101a44d03fb402f9889af2b72ce8abdaed500be0c39acdfa4144b4a4831f6f", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6bdf53f2ef9b121545b6041104cc873d362360efc7520bf762cb027354410a4f", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "64c71e6eebf0ac66b13f03bf32e803350199ffe8069981b97d0ff9a1f197e6c3", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cc101a44d03fb402f9889af2b72ce8abdaed500be0c39acdfa4144b4a4831f6f", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "59e91928951bd4830181338c96468426020449bcc46b4320df3b33f291486fc6", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "64c71e6eebf0ac66b13f03bf32e803350199ffe8069981b97d0ff9a1f197e6c3", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "863129f8f1aafa208eed74c740856f4829d00ea830fa408e9e26ab6aec046688", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "59e91928951bd4830181338c96468426020449bcc46b4320df3b33f291486fc6", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "45cc420b0eba99a01198ac1e289d0da352d85e62589216c3b3bbac6972a65dab", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "863129f8f1aafa208eed74c740856f4829d00ea830fa408e9e26ab6aec046688", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "954664b9272391bee3ea1ab5b7a38f2eeac7f4728ae727622aaa43217d3859dd", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "45cc420b0eba99a01198ac1e289d0da352d85e62589216c3b3bbac6972a65dab", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e968c70dfbf080915acc832a8a0977c3550927c13da5e05940182dac5849d915", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "954664b9272391bee3ea1ab5b7a38f2eeac7f4728ae727622aaa43217d3859dd", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5b33889abc318da00d0be8ac07b592bef1daa39acb5fde8b41a4486c5b3d256b", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e968c70dfbf080915acc832a8a0977c3550927c13da5e05940182dac5849d915", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "2cd8bb54232f4e86b7cea66501956ab7298f953edce6ff9ffd801e8569611517", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5b33889abc318da00d0be8ac07b592bef1daa39acb5fde8b41a4486c5b3d256b", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "1e1e0942ff246d613c73c19ca903f796cb850a3416d54619aa6da444c73598e9", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2cd8bb54232f4e86b7cea66501956ab7298f953edce6ff9ffd801e8569611517", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "5aa8f0b81002c405795f776205d0be9e9640f65d8c17101824162ee1f23935c8", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "1e1e0942ff246d613c73c19ca903f796cb850a3416d54619aa6da444c73598e9", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "eaf8a8e656394d1d28cc5cad8af0af1125d9af2e9190c0bce8700ba7797dbdf0", "id": "T-t6-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "5aa8f0b81002c405795f776205d0be9e9640f65d8c17101824162ee1f23935c8", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 37, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. There is one way to consume the platform, shown as code end to end: what is called, with what, and what comes back.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cc6bbc19b9f6cbffa86c5d2a614bd87a6f9055320e452b2f9d6e0f53a9038bce", "id": "T-t6-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "eaf8a8e656394d1d28cc5cad8af0af1125d9af2e9190c0bce8700ba7797dbdf0", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 38, "line_start": 38, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Four entries cover nearly every situation: a human, an event, a schedule (time), and an external system or agent. All four enter through the same shape.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "bc92cde39dcf0c6ced45708e5c666bc8935e78ace4395e8845d6467b0f640150", "id": "T-t6-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cc6bbc19b9f6cbffa86c5d2a614bd87a6f9055320e452b2f9d6e0f53a9038bce", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 39, "line_start": 39, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Any entry can call complex workflows, agents, and loops that run across the entire stack.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "831e54223ea40f9aadc0313884842417300f24ec81a3a9af297f48be2ac8cdba", "id": "T-t6-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "bc92cde39dcf0c6ced45708e5c666bc8935e78ace4395e8845d6467b0f640150", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 40, "line_start": 40, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Multiple models are used through one gateway, and a fleet of GPUs serves local models; callers request a model class, not a vendor.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "bf59a08e4484573f1e589f6da0008fd8b5e68f16cedeb2b138fc4c92472ab897", "id": "T-t6-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "831e54223ea40f9aadc0313884842417300f24ec81a3a9af297f48be2ac8cdba", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 41, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each agent is defined up front by what it is good at, so callers know how to call it and how to sequence it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f734270e37f475c49c4800931d329b78a8b16608c9084f92c0d65a2dc1311747", "id": "T-t6-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "bf59a08e4484573f1e589f6da0008fd8b5e68f16cedeb2b138fc4c92472ab897", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 42, "line_start": 42, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. The target scale is well over a hundred agents running at a time, working together, managing state, breaking problems down, and self-improving where they can.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "f3169b9669b3f057f55ade0ced5158ab6e80d20d1f19be1b6c133b4650959a9f", "id": "T-t7-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f734270e37f475c49c4800931d329b78a8b16608c9084f92c0d65a2dc1311747", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 46, "line_start": 46, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The harness is an overlay that integrates across every component fluidly; it never pins the integration to a component.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "4e57694d85876f5a3842ff078cf10c9c50673174225133e146e1de5d6adc844a", "id": "T-t7-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "f3169b9669b3f057f55ade0ced5158ab6e80d20d1f19be1b6c133b4650959a9f", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 47, "line_start": 47, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Every harness call goes through the capability interface, and the component sits behind an adapter.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "897e392e7c6aac1bdda31548887bbf594d192ffe64bd54f0b6d9d2eb61b79300", "id": "T-t7-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "4e57694d85876f5a3842ff078cf10c9c50673174225133e146e1de5d6adc844a", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 48, "line_start": 48, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Each component has a minimal call in isolation, and the same calls are linked across the composable elements.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "13011617ec7c6aff67ab49db282392b0a9af4917165502edeb24c8bb44f2e605", "id": "T-t7-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "897e392e7c6aac1bdda31548887bbf594d192ffe64bd54f0b6d9d2eb61b79300", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 49, "line_start": 49, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Standards will change, systems will change, and components will change; the harness shows where the impacts are.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "95472eb2397675ca66025f4678879d233f232da7f6511a02f8c2709ba25cf294", "id": "T-t7-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "13011617ec7c6aff67ab49db282392b0a9af4917165502edeb24c8bb44f2e605", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 50, "line_start": 50, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Changing a component means swapping its adapter, and the conformance run proves the interface held.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "38cb9a221b535da2afedcdd4b2a886d372c20fa1b801fb6b8afa32bc2638b71a", "id": "T-t7-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "95472eb2397675ca66025f4678879d233f232da7f6511a02f8c2709ba25cf294", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 51, "line_start": 51, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. This direction is a target toward perfection, not a fixed definition; improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "84b9b9ff1162e263dd84525ca51bdb1cbe291320d8fb1ebe7ac7497210b2e090", "id": "T-t8-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "38cb9a221b535da2afedcdd4b2a886d372c20fa1b801fb6b8afa32bc2638b71a", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 55, "line_start": 55, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The twelve host-fact gaps in docs/architecture/gap-triage.json are absent on the host today and are design work, not facts to research.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d8d320915a16345ef23952ba083c15c27330f2923120a765b62a5f2596be1325", "id": "T-t8-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "84b9b9ff1162e263dd84525ca51bdb1cbe291320d8fb1ebe7ac7497210b2e090", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 56, "line_start": 56, "sha256": "9be338d9a1f8cc708761876fc405051809f1d7742d8dd001c3ca48e09611a2a5"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Standard-version gaps and does-a-standard-exist gaps are closed by research with real search results, or recorded as none found.", "type": "fact"}
